{"overview":"دو دختربچه به همراه پدرشان به خانه‌ای در دهکده نقل مکان می‌کنند تا به مادر بیمارشان نزدیک‌تر باشند. آن‌ها در جنگل‌های نزدیک دهکده موجوداتی سحر آمیز بنام «تو تو رو» را پیدا می‌کنند و خیلی زود با آن‌ها دوست می‌شوند.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Two sisters move to the country with their father in order to be closer to their hospitalized mother, and discover the surrounding trees are inhabited by Totoros, magical spirits of the forest. When the youngest runs away from home, the older sister seeks help from the spirits to find her.","tagline_en":"He's your friendly neighbourhood forest spirit!","runtime":86,"status":"Released","seasons":[],"episodes":null,"crew":["هایائو میازاکی"],"crew_en":["Hayao Miyazaki"],"countries":["JP"],"cast":[{"name":"日髙のり子","role":"Satsuki Kusakabe (voice)","photo":"/43OuwsjqGf7JxpFpUvB75OdDDXQ.jpg","en":"Noriko Hidaka"},{"name":"坂本千夏","role":"Mei Kusakabe (voice)","photo":"/lIIwnLmcgGpifpRflBq0kLW9EpK.jpg","en":"Chika Sakamoto"},{"name":"高木均","role":"Totoro (voice)","photo":"/lQWkgAGIdJ3Q93xI95ke6LZfzHW.jpg","en":"Hitoshi Takagi"},{"name":"糸井重里","role":"Tatsuo Kusakabe (voice)","photo":"/2V17CMIcxb6JEHT5Qp3FKdlHUoE.jpg","en":"Shigesato Itoi"},{"name":"島本須美","role":"Yasuko Kusakabe (voice)","photo":"/iKIDv2VFpAgzJ0uMQi7pzcMHB9i.jpg","en":"Sumi Shimamoto"},{"name":"北林谷栄","role":"Granny (voice)","photo":"/vGG6ErgXfrZuRsVfDP3Po3XReST.jpg","en":"Tanie Kitabayashi"},{"name":"雨笠利幸","role":"Kanta Ogaki (voice)","photo":"/7DK21dlVcsltO92rcTq5BpZ2J7j.jpg","en":"Toshiyuki Amagasa"},{"name":"丸山優子","role":"Kanta's Mother (voice)","photo":"/fmzNKKcuVpdT2xfdlpk8PAI5kSX.jpg","en":"Yuko Maruyama"},{"name":"広瀬正志","role":"Kanta's Father (voice)","photo":"/lNG8ce8un1U7UIjArEFjzE76BxO.jpg","en":"Masashi Hirose"},{"name":"鈴木れい子","role":"Kanta's Aunt (voice)","photo":"/qgFATlpp1HnAHyhgRJ1QdBYksEG.jpg","en":"Reiko Suzuki"},{"name":"鷲尾真知子","role":"Teacher (voice)","photo":"/qJkhSBhyRt1GRNcEuZB5xPTonEK.jpg","en":"Machiko Washio"},{"name":"龍田直樹","role":"C